B.ae8=new A.bJ("Honey: source gives no quantity, frequency or duration.",!1)
B.aeA=new A.bJ("Nasal care: cool-mist humidifier and sterile saline drops/spray.",!1)
B.aet=new A.bJ("Postinfectious cough: no benefit from inhaled steroids, bronchodilators or oral medicines.",!1)
B.aeE=new A.bJ("Keep the child away from tobacco smoke.",!1)
B.aef=new A.bJ("Menthol/camphor/eucalyptus rubs may ease cough/congestion but can irritate skin, eyes and nose.",!1)
B.aeQ=new A.bJ("Paracetamol: fever/discomfort only; no cough or anti-inflammatory benefit. Not needed if comfortable.",!0)
B.aew=new A.bJ("Recognise possible abuse; assess/treat injuries and provide objective medical information. Do not assign blame or try to prove maltreatment.",!0)
B.aeH=new A.bJ("Prevent recurrent UTI: ask about constipation, daytime wetting and withholding; treat bowel/bladder dysfunction. Hydrate; void every 3-4 hours. Cranberry prevention lacks evidence.",!0)
B.aeb=new A.bJ("Physiological short stature: medically well. Constitutional delay usually needs reassurance; familial short stature needs realistic expectations and explanation that no disease underlies it.",!0)
B.aec=new A.bJ(u.l,!0)
B.aep=new A.bJ(u.b,!0)
B.aeF=new A.bJ(u.L,!0)
B.aeM=new A.bJ(u._,!0)
B.aeP=new A.bJ("Treating-service regimen: refer before starting.",!0)
B.ae7=new A.bJ("Max 4 g/24 h (adult); 60 mg/kg/24 h (child). Overdose can cause severe liver injury; take extra care in children and older adults.",!0)
B.aeN=new A.bJ("MSF reassurance on pregnancy, breastfeeding and aspirin allergy.",!1)
B.ael=new A.bJ("Purulent sputum alone does not establish bacterial infection or justify antibiotics.",!0)
B.ae9=new A.bJ("Max 5 consecutive days.",!0)
B.aeD=new A.bJ("Max 8 sprays/24 h (adults); 4 sprays/24 h (children).",!0)
B.aex=new A.bJ("Contraindicated: MAO inhibitors (including the previous 2 weeks), narrow-angle glaucoma, acute coronary disease or cardiac asthma, rhinitis sicca, and after transsphenoidal hypophysectomy.",!0)
B.aek=new A.bJ("Max 4 g/day (adults); 60 mg/kg/day (children).",!0)
B.aee=new A.bJ("Label gives no spray count or schedule; frequency here is conventional practice.",!0)
B.ae2=new A.bJ("Penicillin allergy: contraindicated.",!0)
B.aeh=new A.bJ("Blood-stained sputum: urgent work-up.",!0)
B.aeB=new A.bJ("Large-volume purulent sputum: assess bronchiectasis; refer.",!0)
B.aeg=new A.bJ("Persistent symptoms + weight loss/night sweats: TB work-up before/alongside antibiotics.",!0)
B.aed=new A.bJ("Penicillin allergy: avoid.",!0)
B.aeK=new A.bJ("Severe renal impairment: reduce dose.",!0)
B.ae5=new A.bJ("Glandular fever: rash risk.",!0)
B.aer=new A.bJ("Suspected diphtheria or deep-space abscess: immediate intervention.",!0)
B.aeO=new A.bJ("Peritonsillar abscess/suppurative complication: hospital care; drainage/IV treatment.",!0)
B.aeo=new A.bJ("Honey: never under 1 year (infant botulism risk). Source gives no quantity, frequency or duration.",!0)
B.ae4=new A.bJ("Check other cold preparations for paracetamol; avoid exceeding the total daily maximum.",!0)
B.aeu=new A.bJ("Severe acute malnutrition: paracetamol 10 mg/kg per dose, no more than 3 doses/24 hours.",!0)
B.aeq=new A.bJ("Dengue with warning signs: child paracetamol 10 mg/kg, 3-4 times daily.",!0)
B.aey=new A.bJ("Hepatic impairment: use paracetamol with caution.",!0)
B.aeI=new A.bJ("Uncomplicated viral cold/acute bronchitis: no routine antibiotics or antivirals.",!0)
B.ae6=new A.bJ("Assess for GAS pharyngitis, severe acute otitis media, or sinusitis lasting over 10 days/worsening after initial improvement; these need a different pathway.",!0)
B.ae3=new A.bJ("Avoid OTC cough/cold preparations in children under 12; they have no proven benefit and overdoses can be fatal. Sources give different lower age cut-offs.",!0)
B.aei=new A.bJ("Under 6 years: cough/cold medicines carry risk; antihistamine/decongestant overdose can be fatal.",!0)
B.aez=new A.bJ("Codeine: do not use in children.",!0)
